{"2467880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fading Echo", "steam_appid": 2467880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4814560, 4814570], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER WATER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a living sphere of water.<br>Surf through pipes. Slip through cracks. Crash from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch devastating water waves. Unleash charged water blasts.<br>Turn mobility into momentum and momentum into destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water isn’t just movement, it’s a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix water with lava, toxic waste, and Paradox corruption to trigger explosive chain reactions.<br>Drench. Conduct. Solidify. Ruin their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element reacts.<br>Every encounter escalates.<br>Push the systems far enough, and they push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity isn’t optional. It’s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFERENT REALITIES. DIFFERENT RULES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world, Corel, exists across fractured realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross into alternate versions of the same space where resources shift, hazards evolve, and combat rules change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What worked before may fail.<br>What was safe may turn volatile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast.<br>Exploit instability.<br>Turn shifting conditions into advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield never stays the same, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP THE PARADOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paradox Corruption is tearing Corel apart, warping reality and consuming everything in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are One, a young Legend with dangerous power and little time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile floating isles and collapsing worlds to stop the Paradox before it devours what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maddock, the ruthless leader of the Paradox on Corel, shows no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t about playing fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about surviving long enough to change what’s left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOLO GAME WITH A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fight alone, but you’re not without allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Corel, a small crew of misfits stands with you. Some out of loyalty. Some out of guilt. Some because they have nowhere else to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their presence shapes the world, the stakes, and the cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because saving a fractured world isn’t just about power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about who’s still standing when the dust settles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a premium cast that brings every alliance and every conflict to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER WATER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into a living sphere of water.<br>Surf through pipes. Slip through cracks. Crash from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch devastating water waves. Unleash charged water blasts.<br>Turn mobility into momentum and momentum into destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water isn’t just movement, it’s a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix water with lava, toxic waste, and Paradox corruption to trigger explosive chain reactions.<br>Drench. Conduct. Solidify. Ruin their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element reacts.<br>Every encounter escalates.<br>Push the systems far enough, and they push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity isn’t optional. It’s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/3f38ca18f06cee9902559bc44454567a.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFERENT REALITIES. DIFFERENT RULES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your world, Corel, exists across fractured realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross into alternate versions of the same space where resources shift, hazards evolve, and combat rules change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What worked before may fail.<br>What was safe may turn volatile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt fast.<br>Exploit instability.<br>Turn shifting conditions into advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield never stays the same, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/030b58700fd5e3899f98dec7e62f97c7.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOP THE PARADOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paradox Corruption is tearing Corel apart, warping reality and consuming everything in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are One, a young Legend with dangerous power and little time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile floating isles and collapsing worlds to stop the Paradox before it devours what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maddock, the ruthless leader of the Paradox on Corel, shows no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t about playing fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about surviving long enough to change what’s left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/1ab298f3a339059cd47554b53aacb7b9.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOLO GAME WITH A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may fight alone, but you’re not without allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across Corel, a small crew of misfits stands with you. Some out of loyalty. Some out of guilt. Some because they have nowhere else to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their presence shapes the world, the stakes, and the cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because saving a fractured world isn’t just about power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s about who’s still standing when the dust settles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a premium cast that brings every alliance and every conflict to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.poster.avif?t=1786513624\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.webm?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/extras/6530d2a62e758ddf70b9626e7ef30760.mp4?t=1786513624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fading Echo is a fast-paced elemental action-adventure RPG where creativity fuels combat. Manipulate water, trigger chain reactions, and shift through surreal worlds as One, a young Legend on a mission to save a dying desertscape from the grip of the Paradox corruption.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/e39036b077d6aee96e3e0b2e7929a55c4735957e/header.jpg?t=1786513624", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467880/8911f722ab88dd638c48a